name: sim.handleCustomizationScripts
description: 
luaSynopsis: int count=sim.handleCustomizationScripts(int callType)
inputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. callType: the desired system call type (e.g. sysCall_actuation).
outputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. count: number of called customization scripts
